30" end="00:14.010"><span begin="00:10.830" end="00:11.640">Hey</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.010" end="00:16.380"><span begin="00:14.010" end="00:14.820">Hey</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.380" end="00:19.590"><span begin="00:16.380" end="00:16.950">Singing </span><span begin="00:16.950" end="00:17.370">hymns </span><span begin="00:17.370" end="00:17.580">all </span><span begin="00:17.580" end="00:17.940">alone </span><span begin="00:17.940" end="00:18.060">in </span><span begin="00:18.060" end="00:18.270">my </span><span begin="00:18.270" end="00:19.500">basement</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.590" end="00:22.170"><span begin="00:19.590" end="00:19.950">So </span><span begin="00:19.950" end="00:20.550">close </span><span begin="00:20.550" end="00:20.670">I </span><span begin="00:20.670" end="00:20.940">could </span><span begin="00:20.940" end="00:21.540">almost </span><span begin="00:21.540" end="00:22.020">taste </span><span begin="00:22.020" end="00:22.170">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.170" end="00:23.550"><span begin="00:22.170" end="00:22.920">Hey</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.550" end="00:23.760"><span begin="00:23.550" end="00:23.760">Hey</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.760" end="00:26.790"><span begin="00:23.760" end="00:24.517">Cut </span><span begin="00:24.517" end="00:25.274">it </span><span begin="00:25.274" end="00:26.031">off</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.790" end="00:27.690"><span begin="00:26.790" end="00:27.210">Cut </span><span begin="00:27.210" end="00:27.300">it </span><span begin="00:27.300" end="00:27.690">off</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.690" end="00:29.160"><span begin="00:27.690" end="00:28.057">Cut </span><span begin="00:28.057" end="00:28.424">it </span><span begin="00:28.424" end="00:28.791">off</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.160" end="00:35.850"><span begin="00:29.160" end="00:29.550">Cut </span><span begin="00:29.550" end="00:29.700">it </span><span begin="00:29.700" end="00:29.790">off</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.850" end="00:39.270"><span begin="00:35.850" end="00:37.020">Crucified </span><span begin="00:37.020" end="00:37.200">for </span><span begin="00:37.200" end="00:37.350">the </span><span begin="00:37.350" end="00:37.860">life </span><span begin="00:37.860" end="00:38.130">I'm </span><span begin="00:38.130" end="00:39.240">living</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.270" end="00:42.330"><span begin="00:39.270" end="00:39.360">Oh </span><span begin="00:39.360" end="00:39.690">my </span><span begin="00:39.690" end="00:40.290">God</span><span begin="00:40.290" end="00:40.290">, </span><span begin="00:40.290" end="00:40.650">hope </span><span begin="00:40.650" end="00:40.950">I'm </span><span begin="00:40.950" end="00:42.330">forgiven</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.330" end="00:48.480"><span begin="00:42.330" end="00:42.810">Going </span><span begin="00:42.810" end="00:42.870">to </span><span begin="00:42.870" end="00:43.380">hell </span><span begin="00:43.380" end="00:43.410"> </span><span begin="00:43.410" end="00:43.650">'cause </span><span begin="00:43.650" end="00:43.770">it </span><span begin="00:43.770" end="00:44.220">feels </span><span begin="00:44.220" end="00:44.610">like </span><span begin="00:44.610" end="00:46.230">heaven</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.480" end="00:51.960"><span begin="00:48.480" end="00:49.200">Speaking </span><span begin="00:49.200" end="00:49.290">in </span><span begin="00:49.290" end="00:49.740">tongues </span><span begin="00:49.740" end="00:49.920">to </span><span begin="00:49.920" end="00:50.520">release </span><span begin="00:50.520" end="00:50.880">my </span><span begin="00:50.880" end="00:51.960">demons</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.960" end="00:54.990"><span begin="00:51.960" end="00:52.110">I </span><span begin="00:52.110" end="00:52.500">can't </span><span begin="00:52.500" end="00:52.950">help </span><spa