ff</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.090" end="01:36.480"><span begin="01:33.090" end="01:34.230">Crucified </span><span begin="01:34.230" end="01:34.410">for </span><span begin="01:34.410" end="01:34.560">the </span><span begin="01:34.560" end="01:35.070">life </span><span begin="01:35.070" end="01:35.340">I'm </span><span begin="01:35.340" end="01:36.450">living</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.480" end="01:39.540"><span begin="01:36.480" end="01:36.600">Oh </span><span begin="01:36.600" end="01:36.840">my </span><span begin="01:36.840" end="01:37.500">god</span><span begin="01:37.500" end="01:37.500">, </span><span begin="01:37.500" end="01:37.890">hope </span><span begin="01:37.890" end="01:38.160">I'm </span><span begin="01:38.160" end="01:39.540">forgiven</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.540" end="01:45.750"><span begin="01:39.540" end="01:40.050">Going </span><span begin="01:40.050" end="01:40.110">to </span><span begin="01:40.110" end="01:40.590">hell </span><span begin="01:40.590" end="01:40.620"> </span><span begin="01:40.620" end="01:40.860">'cause </span><span begin="01:40.860" end="01:40.980">it </span><span begin="01:40.980" end="01:41.430">feels </span><span begin="01:41.430" end="01:41.820">like </span><span begin="01:41.820" end="01:43.140">heaven</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.750" end="01:49.170"><span begin="01:45.750" end="01:46.410">Speaking </span><span begin="01:46.410" end="01:46.530">in </span><span begin="01:46.530" end="01:46.980">tongues </span><span begin="01:46.980" end="01:47.160">to </span><span begin="01:47.160" end="01:47.760">release </span><span begin="01:47.760" end="01:48.060">my </span><span begin="01:48.060" end="01:49.170">demons</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.170" end="01:52.230"><span begin="01:49.170" end="01:49.320">I </span><span begin="01:49.320" end="01:49.740">can't </span><span begin="01:49.740" end="01:50.160">help </span><span begin="01:50.160" end="01:50.310">it</span><s